.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH urlmenu-open 1  "open " 
.SH NAME
urlmenu\-open \- Open URLs (or nothing) with a target id from `list` or `items`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBurlmenu open\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-target\fR> [\fIURLS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open URLs (or nothing) with a target id from `list` or `items`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would run as JSON instead of running it
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIURLS\fR]

